    {"id": "info", "displayName": "Info", "slicers": [], "tiles": [],
     "visuals": [
      {"type": "textbox", "x": 16, "y": 56, "w": 616, "h": 236, "card": true, "alt": "About", "paragraphs": [{"text": "About", "size": 13, "bold": true}, "Quillstack Software is a fictional B2B software company in Lisbon, Portugal. Its support desk answers customers in four teams: Service Desk, Technical Support, Billing & Accounts and Integrations.", "This report shows the help-desk export from January 2024 to September 2025: volume, SLA compliance in business hours, teams and agents, backlog and ageing.", {"text": "The company, the customers, the agents and the tickets are invented.", "colour": "muted"}, {"text": "Rebuilt from memory as a demo. The original client's name and data are not used.", "colour": "muted"}]},
      {"type": "textbox", "x": 648, "y": 56, "w": 616, "h": 236, "card": true, "alt": "Data", "paragraphs": [{"text": "Data", "size": 13, "bold": true}, "Tickets: data/tickets (one file per creation quarter, 2024-Q1 to 2025-Q3); status changes: data/ticket_events (the same quarters). Reference files: agents.csv, teams.csv, priorities.csv, holidays.csv, business_hours_cases.csv.", "All files are generated by tools/make_data.py with seed 20240101. The export ends on 30 September 2025 at 18:00 (as of); the cards below show what the refresh read."]},
      {"type": "textbox", "x": 16, "y": 304, "w": 1248, "h": 196, "card": true, "alt": "Definitions", "paragraphs": [{"text": "Definitions", "size": 13, "bold": true}, "Business hours: Monday to Friday 08:00 to 18:00 Lisbon time, public holidays of data/holidays.csv excluded; durations are business minutes computed in Power Query by fnBusinessMinutes.", "Statuses: New, Open, Pending, Resolved, Closed, Reopened. The clock runs in New, Open and Reopened; Pending and Resolved pause it. First response = the time in New.", "SLA outcome per ticket: Met, Breached or Pending against the priority's target; met % = met / (met + breached). Every ticket measure counts by creation date, Resolved by resolution date, so the last weeks before the export hold fewer resolved tickets and lower resolution times.", "Backlog: open tickets at the end of the period, from the status changes; age in calendar days from the creation date."]},
      {"type": "card", "x": 16, "y": 512, "w": 408, "h": 84, "title": "Ticket files read", "label_size": 16, "roles": {"Values": [["_Measures", "Ticket files", "Measure"]]}},
      {"type": "card", "x": 436, "y": 512, "w": 408, "h": 84, "title": "Event files read", "label_size": 16, "roles": {"Values": [["_Measures", "Event files", "Measure"]]}},
      {"type": "card", "x": 856, "y": 512, "w": 408, "h": 84, "title": "Business-hours test cases passed", "label_size": 16, "roles": {"Values": [["_Measures", "BH tests result", "Measure"]]}},
      {"type": "textbox", "x": 16, "y": 608, "w": 1248, "h": 96, "card": true, "alt": "Repository", "paragraphs": [{"text": "Repository", "size": 13, "bold": true}, "github.com/HARISPAARTAN/support-ticket-analytics"]}
     ]},
